@startuml state-lead
title OWBS — Machine à états du lead (côté métier)
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> Draft : newLeadId() (client)
Draft --> Captured : lead_create upsert (phone+consent)
Captured --> AddressDone : address_update upsert
AddressDone --> PaymentSelected : payment_select upsert
PaymentSelected --> Purchased : order_create (idempotent strict)
Purchased --> [*]

Captured --> Abandoned : scanner (timeout sans conversion)
AddressDone --> Abandoned : scanner
PaymentSelected --> Abandoned : scanner
Abandoned --> Purchased : reprise tardive (idempotent)

note right of Captured
  Row chat_lead partielle persistée
  => alimente scanner + funnel analytics
end note
note right of Purchased
  order_create embarque le snapshot complet
  => indépendant des écritures de fond en vol
end note
@enduml
